<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Agreement</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
      max-width: 7.5in;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.75in;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #000;
      font-size: 11pt;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 20pt 0;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    p {
      margin: 12pt 0;
    }
    .parties-section {
      margin: 30pt 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .party-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20pt;
      margin-bottom: 5pt;
    }
    .party-underline {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 120pt;
      height: 20pt;
    }
    .party-labels {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 140pt;
      margin-top: 5pt;
    }
    .party-label {
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    .disagreement {
      margin: 20pt 0;
    }
    .full-underline {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 18pt;
      margin: 5pt 0;
    }
    .inline-underline {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 100pt;
      padding: 0 5pt 2pt 5pt;
    }
    ol {
      margin-left: 20pt;
      padding-left: 20pt;
    }
    li {
      margin: 12pt 0;
      text-align: justify;
    }
    .payment-list {
      margin-left: 20pt;
      list-style-type: lower-alpha;
    }
    .payment-list li {
      margin: 8pt 0;
    }
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 50pt;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .sig-block {
      width: 40%;
    }
    .sig-underline {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 25pt;
      margin-bottom: 5pt;
    }
    .sig-label {
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    @media print {
      body {
        padding: 0.5in;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>AGREEMENT</h1>
  
  <p style="text-align: center;">This is the Agreement reached between:</p>
  
  <div class="parties-section">
    <div class="party-line">
      <span class="party-underline" data-agreement-field="landlord_name"><%= @landlord %></span>
      <span style="font-size: 12pt;">and</span>
      <span class="party-underline" data-agreement-field="tenant_name"><%= @tenant %></span>
    </div>
    <div class="party-labels">
      <span class="party-label">LANDLORD</span>
      <span class="party-label">TENANT</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="disagreement">
    <p>The parties had a disagreement about their rights and responsibilities as to:</p>
    <span class="full-underline" data-agreement-field="address"><%= @address %></span>
  </div>
  
  <p>The parties took part in a negotiation session held on <span class="inline-underline" data-agreement-field="negotiation_date" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @date.respond_to?(:strftime) ? @date.strftime('%B %d, %Y') : (@date.present? ? @date : "____________") %></span> and agreed to the following:</p>

  <ol>
    <li>Tenant shall vacate by 11:59 PM on <span class="inline-underline" data-agreement-field="vacate_date" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= @vacate_date.present? ? (Date.parse(@vacate_date).strftime('%B %d, %Y') rescue @vacate_date) : "____________" %></span>.</li>
    
    <li>If Tenant vacates as agreed, Landlord shall not take legal action against Tenant.</li>
    
    <li>Landlord will restrict public access to online information concerning the Tenant's rights or responsibilities with respect to the subject of the Agreement.</li>
    
    <li>If Tenant fails to vacate as agreed, Landlord may submit an affidavit detailing the failure and be entitled to a (Comm Order?) return to possession as paragraph.</li>
    
    <% if @schedule.present? && @schedule.any? %>
    <li>Tenant agrees to pay Landlord in the following manner:
      <ol class="payment-list">
        <% @schedule.each do |index, amount, due_date| %>
          <% if amount.present? %>
            <li data-agreement-payment-row="<%= index %>">$<span class="inline-underline" data-agreement-field="amount<%= index %>"><%= amount %></span> on or before <span class="inline-underline" data-agreement-field="date<%= index %>" data-agreement-format="long-date"><%= due_date.present? ? (Date.parse(due_date).strftime('%B %d, %Y') rescue due_date) : "_________________" %></span> by 5:00 PM</li>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </ol>
    </li>
    <% end %>
    <li data-agreement-payment-anchor style="display: none;"></li>
    
    <li>Payments shall be in the form of previous rent payments.</li>
    
    <li>Both parties agree that this Agreement may be executed in one or more counterparts, each of which may be signed by a party individually. Upon execution by all parties, their respective signed copies of this Agreement shall be combined into a single, integrated document. The integrated agreement shall be considered as one and the same.</li>
    
    <li>Both parties agree that any additional provisions listed below are part of this agreement.</li>
  </ol>
  
  <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40pt; font-weight: bold;">[SIGNATURE PAGE FOLLOWS]</p>
  
  <p style="margin-top: 30pt;">Agreed to by:</p>
  
  <div class="signature-section">
    <div class="sig-block">
      <span class="sig-underline"></span>
      <div class="sig-label">
        <span>Landlord</span>
        <span style="float: right;">Date</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="sig-block">
      <span class="sig-underline"></span>
      <div class="sig-label">
        <span>Tenant</span>
        <span style="float: right;">Date</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
